  {
    "title": "你只是在用工具，还是在造工具？",
    "seo_summary": "多数人满足于做工具使用者，少数人选择冒险成为工具制造者。本文探讨人类使用和创造工具的本质差异，揭示创造新工具如何推动社会进步。思考你在这个时代的角色。",
    "url": "https://seths.blog/2026/09/homo-habilis",
    "cover": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-renzhi-hub/main/assets/rss_covers/de78a13c18117da0.jpg",
    "wechat_html": "<section style='margin:0;padding:0;background-color:#fff;'><img src='https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/3hAJnwuyZuicicZkgJBUCCaricdibomDBrTzXgUR7FJnf11qGIo8nmKt6RxibXrb5s4RFb9UZ9UOHQy7fqQyI377Licw/0?wx_fmt=gif' style='width:100%;display:block;'><section style='padding:0;'><img peitu='true' src='https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-renzhi-hub/main/assets/rss_covers/de78a13c18117da0.jpg' style='width:100%;display:block;margin:30px 0;'><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">你每天都在用工具。</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">从手机到各种软件，它们让你的生活高效运转。</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">但你可能没想过，这种“高效”背后，藏着一个残酷真相。</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">你只是一个工具使用者。</p><section style=\"margin:50px 0 25px 0; border-bottom:1px solid #E5E5E5; padding-bottom:12px; display:flex; align-items:center;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block; width:5px; height:18px; background-color:#111; margin-right:12px;\"></span><strong style=\"font-size:19px; color:#111; letter-spacing:1.5px;\">从“能人”到“造物者”</strong></section><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">几百万年前，我们被称为“能人”（Homo Habilis）。</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">这个名字的由来很简单：他们会使用工具。</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">这是最早一批能清晰运用工具的原始人类。</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">他们的出现，标志着人类文明的开端。</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">工具的定义很宽泛。</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">从石器、火种，到今天的智能手机和人工智能。</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">你身边的一切，几乎都是工具的延伸。</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">我们离不开它们，甚至依赖它们。</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">现在，一个尖锐的问题摆在你面前：</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">你是一个工具使用者，还是一个工具制造者？</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">你肯定会说，我当然是工具使用者。</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">这没错，我们每个人都在用各种工具。</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">但真正选择去“制造”工具的人，却少得可怜。</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">即便你拥有强大的AI、各种杠杆系统。</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">你能轻松调用海量资源。</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">但大多数人依然停留在使用层面。</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">他们不愿意慢下来。</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">去冒失败的风险。</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">去承担创造的责任。</p><section style=\"margin:35px 0; padding:15px 0 15px 20px; border-left:3px solid #111; background-color:#FAFAFA; color:#555; font-size:15px; line-height:1.9;\"><strong style=\"color:#000; font-weight:bold;\">这其中的差异，不是能力，而是选择。</strong></section><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">你习惯了被动接受，享受工具带来的便利。</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">但你可能没意识到，真正的改变，往往源于少数人。</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">那些敢于打破现状、亲手打造新工具的人。</p><section style=\"margin:50px 0 25px 0; border-bottom:1px solid #E5E5E5; padding-bottom:12px; display:flex; align-items:center;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block; width:5px; height:18px; background-color:#111; margin-right:12px;\"></span><strong style=\"font-size:19px; color:#111; letter-spacing:1.5px;\">比损失更可怕的，是原地踏步</strong></section><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">一个高效的工具使用者，通常不会主动思考。</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">为什么要停下当前的“生产”？</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">去投入时间和精力制造一个全新的东西？</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">他会觉得，这会打乱节奏。</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">带来不确定性，甚至可能一无所获。</p><section style=\"margin:35px 0; padding:15px 0 15px 20px; border-left:3px solid #111; background-color:#FAFAFA; color:#555; font-size:15px; line-height:1.9;\"><strong style=\"color:#000; font-weight:bold;\">但比损失更可怕的，是原地踏步。</strong></section><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">新的工具，正是我们推动世界进步的方式。</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">它们重新定义了游戏规则，打开了新的可能。</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">想想蒸汽机、互联网、AI大模型。</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">它们都曾是少数人的“异想天开”。</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">你所用的每一个工具，都曾是某个人创造的。</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">他们为此冒着巨大风险。</p><section style=\"margin:50px 0 25px 0; border-bottom:1px solid #E5E5E5; padding-bottom:12px; display:flex; align-items:center;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block; width:5px; height:18px; background-color:#111; margin-right:12px;\"></span><strong style=\"font-size:19px; color:#111; letter-spacing:1.5px;\">去亲手打造你的世界</strong></section><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">所以，当你下次拿起手机，打开软件时。</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">不妨问问自己：我除了使用，还能做些什么？</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">你是否愿意停下来，哪怕一点点？</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">去思考如何改进一个流程，设计一个小程序。</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">或者仅仅是优化一个工作方法？</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">这种思考和行动，就是进化的开始。</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">从“能人”向“造物者”（Homo Faciens）进化。</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">真正的力量，不只在于利用现有工具。</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">更在于创造工具。</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">别只做工具人。</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">去亲手打造你的世界。</p><section style='margin:45px 0 20px 0;padding-top:20px;border-top:1px solid #E5E5E5;'><section style='font-size:13px;color:#999;margin-bottom:12px;text-transform:uppercase;'>TAGS</section><section><span style='display:inline-block;margin:0 10px 10px 0;padding:4px 12px;border:1px solid #DCDFE6;color:#606266;font-size:12px;'>工具思维</span><span style='display:inline-block;margin:0 10px 10px 0;padding:4px 12px;border:1px solid #DCDFE6;color:#606266;font-size:12px;'>创造力</span><span style='display:inline-block;margin:0 10px 10px 0;padding:4px 12px;border:1px solid #DCDFE6;color:#606266;font-size:12px;'>认知升级</span><span style='display:inline-block;margin:0 10px 10px 0;padding:4px 12px;border:1px solid #DCDFE6;color:#606266;font-size:12px;'>行动指南</span><span style='display:inline-block;margin:0 10px 10px 0;padding:4px 12px;border:1px solid #DCDFE6;color:#606266;font-size:12px;'>个人成长</span></section></section></section><img src='https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/3hAJnwuyZuicicZkgJBUCCaricdibomDBrTzk57DCmhVC16o9ILH0Tn1YPEiarfLRRQSVFN2mJdeYibGnBPialPIzvojw/0?wx_fmt=gif' style='width:100%;display:block;'></section>",
